	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bf3a5e2fb8b33ea3","type":"group","label":"Callers","x":-1000,"y":-60,"width":520,"height":760},
		{"id":"d740ea2e25ec6e57","type":"group","label":"lightbox-dialog.njk","x":-420,"y":-60,"width":1100,"height":1240},
		{"id":"0e6ff9eac8ec8061","type":"group","label":"Behavior","x":740,"y":-60,"width":560,"height":760},
		{"id":"394d0b0642ffec6c","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/molecules/figure/media.md","x":-980,"y":-20,"width":480,"height":300},
		{"id":"f3a9176b6ebd91be","type":"text","text":"### PortableText image serializer\n`data/sanity/transforms/portableText.js` → `types.image`\n\n**Hand-built mirror**, not a caller. `@portabletext/to-html` returns HTML strings, so it can't import a Nunjucks macro.\n\n⚠️ Change both together — markup, classes, caption, `aria-label`.","x":-980,"y":320,"width":480,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7e5bfafeba1f41c5","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/molecules/lightbox/lightbox-dialog.md","x":-400,"y":-20,"width":500,"height":300},
		{"id":"933740080ebb33d4","type":"text","text":"### Params\n| Param | Use |\n|---|---|\n| `video` | `{ src, poster, mimeType }` — wins |\n| `picture` | pre-rendered HTML — wins over `src` |\n| `src` | image URL |\n| `width` / `height` | intrinsic size of `src` |\n| `alt` | `src` alt + dialog name |\n| `caption` | dialog caption |","x":140,"y":-20,"width":520,"height":300},
		{"id":"2280a1ba15a14c57","type":"text","text":"### Anatomy\n```\n<dialog data-lightbox-el=\"dialog\"\n        aria-label=alt|caption|fallback>\n  <button data-lightbox-el=\"close\">Close\n  <figure class=\"grid\">\n    media (see precedence)\n    <figcaption data-lightbox-el=\n      \"dialog-caption\">   ← if caption\n  </figure>\n</dialog>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import Lightbox.js\n```\nRoot + trigger belong to the **caller**.","x":-400,"y":320,"width":500,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a0182bf044c7ecea","type":"text","text":"### Media precedence\n1. **`video.src`** → `<video data-lightbox-el=\"video\" muted playsinline controls preload=\"none\">`\n2. **`picture`** → `<span>` wrapping the HTML; inner `<img>` styled via `[&_img]:`\n3. **`src`** → `<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">` + `width`/`height` when given; `w-auto h-auto` under `max-w-full max-h-[75vh]`\n\nNothing is fetched until the dialog opens.\n\n**Fallback name:** `Video viewer` / `Image viewer` (`or`, not `default` — empty strings fall through).","x":140,"y":320,"width":520,"height":420},
		{"id":"a7e9023a1dddae02","type":"text","text":"### Layout\n| Case | Result |\n|---|---|\n| No caption | Media fills dialog, max `90vw` × `75vh` |\n| Caption, below `lg` (md and smaller) | Caption **below** media |\n| Caption, `lg`+ | `lg:grid-cols-3` — media `lg:col-span-2`, caption right third; dialog fixed `lg:w-[90vw]` so the grid has a definite width |\n\nCursor: `zoom-out` on the backdrop, `auto` over content. Backdrop `bg-black/80`, caption `text-neutral-200`.","x":-400,"y":780,"width":1060,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"4e75f8c6c1ba4609","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/lightbox/Lightbox.md","x":760,"y":-20,"width":520,"height":300},
		{"id":"2869e6cfed037faf","type":"text","text":"### Lightbox.js\n| Event | Result |\n|---|---|\n| init + dialog caption | caption gets an id; dialog `aria-describedby` → caption |\n| trigger click | `showModal()` |\n| open + video | `play()` muted — **skipped** under `prefers-reduced-motion` |\n| Close / backdrop / Escape | `close()` |\n| dialog `close` event | video `pause()` |\n\nFocus trap + Escape are native `<dialog>`.","x":760,"y":320,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e08f7450dafff63c","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/specs/views/lightbox.views-spec.md","x":-400,"y":-560,"width":1060,"height":400,"color":"3"}
	],
